※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4678
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4678 LANG_RESUME_ARGUMENTS

※ A walk taking something back is resumed with it, and one taking nothing
※ with nothing.

fn acc(start: u64) ⇉ u64 ⇇ u64:
    let more := yield start
    yield more

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let c := ⎕start(acc(1u64))
    let a := ⎕resume(c)
    0u6
